# MAGIC ## 💡 Performance Best Practices Summary
# MAGIC
# MAGIC | Technique | Impact | When to use |
# MAGIC |-----------|--------|------------|
# MAGIC | **Liquid Clustering** | 2-10x faster queries | Tables queried with consistent filter columns |
# MAGIC | **Broadcast joins** | Eliminate shuffle | Small table (<\~1GB) joined to large table |
# MAGIC | **CTEs / Temp views** | Avoid recomputation | Same intermediate result used multiple times |
# MAGIC | **Column pruning** | Less I/O | `SELECT col1, col2` instead of `SELECT *` |
# MAGIC | **Predicate pushdown** | Scan less data | Filter early in the query (`WHERE` before `JOIN`) |
# MAGIC | **OPTIMIZE** | Compact small files | After many small writes (streaming, inserts) |
